      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>CONTROLS</b>

    WASD move  |  hold RIGHT mouse + move = rotate camera

    ` 
    All    1 Builder    2 Ranged    3 Melee    4 Medic

    LEFT click: tap = send
    1 troop, hold = send the group

    RIGHT click: tap = recall 1, hold = recall
    the group

    LEFT + RIGHT together = SWEEP (steer troops directly)

    Z =
    target nearest / next    X = clear target

    Q = guard flag    Ctrl tap = run
    stored path

    K / L = flip a waypoint (S4)   E = wake enemy (S7)   M = killer
    (S6)   B = open walls (S7)

    F1 Hub, F2-F8 stations 1-7   H hide help   F12
    reset

    Esc frees the mouse cursor'
